[agent] Now the online/low-latency serving part. This requires a Vertex AI **Feature Online Store + Feature View** (the piece where the platform "distinguishes the two"). Let me confirm the exact command surface available under `gcloud ai`:
[agent:bash] gcloud ai --help 2>&1 | grep -A40 "GROUPS" | grep -iE "feature|online|view|store" ; echo "exit=$?"
